This directory contains scripts which demonstrate the Dirac-style
syntax and a few string manipulation features.

Scripts
-------

create_cat_state.qpro: Function which creates an n-qubit cat state.

create_w_state.qpro: Function which creates an n-qubit w state.

create_equal_even_odd.qpro: Function which creates an equal superpostion
                            with phases of even qubits changed
			    conditionally on the odd qubits.

gen_states.qpro: Uses the above three functions with small values of n.

projector.qpro: Demonstrates the inner and outer product in the
                Dirac-style notation with a simple measurement
                example.

